    "author": "WarpForge Examples",
    "description": "Editable 3x2 launcher dock \u2014 six clickable tiles arranged in a grid; each tile opens a URL or app via the OS shell handler. Add new tiles from the Stage panel's sprite library, remove tiles via the - Remove button, and edit a tile's URL by selecting its sprite and changing the URL field in its when-clicked stack. The Mail tile uses a mailto: URI to open the default mail app; the others open websites. Demonstrates scratch_io_open_url + when_this_sprite_clicked + grid layout.",
